# Adria Stay Budva — Phase 1
#
# No environment variables are required to run Phase 1.
#
# Phase 1 uses:
#   - A deterministic, keyword-based mock chat service (no AI API key needed)
#   - The browser's LocalStorage for demo conversations, leads and settings
#     (no database, no server-side persistence)
#   - Remote placeholder images over public HTTPS (no image API key needed)
#
# This file exists so the project structure matches what later phases will
# need. Future phases will add variables here, for example:
#
#   # Phase 2 — Supabase & owner authentication
#   # NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
#   # NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#   # SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
#
#   # Phase 3 — Real AI API
#   # ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Until then, `npm install && npm run dev` is all you need.
